        <mxCell id="03-PC01-A3" value="PC01.A.3【门3】&lt;code&gt;workflow gate project_design_init --confirmed&lt;/code&gt;；门1+门2；user_confirmed=true，Stage done。写 .workflow_loop/project.json：project_design_initialized=true；architecture.preliminary_done=true；current_stage=spec。&lt;br&gt;Journal 用户确认/阶段推进。" style="rounded=1;arcSize=4;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF8E5;strokeColor=#F59E0B;fontColor=#92400E;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=8;strokeWidth=3;" parent="1" vertex="1">
